cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "WAQF Framework: The 2D Prophetic Management Cycle (Wijhah – 'Azam – Qiyam – Fahs × SAFT)"
message: "If you adopt, teach, or build upon the WAQF Prophetic Management Cycle in research, training, or organizational SOPs, please cite this specification."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Abelian
    given-names: Ridlo
    website: "https://ridlo.id"
abstract: >-
  WAQF Framework is an open, value-laden 2D Prophetic Management standard
  replacing value-neutral Western loops (PDCA, POAC, MBO, OKR, 4DX) by
  uniting the 4-stage WAQF operational cycle—Wijhah (Niyyah, Ru'yah &
  Al-Miqdar), 'Azam (Syura, Tadbir & Tafwidh), Qiyam (Itqan, Uswah &
  I'anah), and Fahs (Hisbah, At-Tahqiq & Muhasabah)—with the 4 Prophetic
  character traits (SAFT: Shiddiq, Amanah, Fathanah, Tabligh), operationalized
  through 13 Hadith and Sirah protocols, a 1-Page Execution Canvas, GitHub
  governance templates, JSON Schema, and an AI Agent Skill.
